  exitK: '02 / THE SYSTEM CLOSES', exitS: 'Spectacle as governance.', exitP: 'Entry 47 is not a day; it is the system that generates days. The construction schedule, the performer register, the mechanical water display, the official banner, and the platform where ten thousand voices were led to shout — all one designed apparatus. The festival does not happen; it is produced.', exitQ: '宣和與民同樂。',
  srcH2: 'The system is textual. The rhetoric is official.', srcP: WITNESS + ' The 宣和與民同樂 banner is labeled OFFICIAL CLAIM; the lantern mountain mechanical system is TEXT; the performer register includes three artists already seen in Entry 41.',
