  units: [
    { h2: 'GO → RITUAL → RETURN.', label: 'ONE SENTENCE',
      text: '十五日詣上清宮，亦有對御，至晚回內。',
      trans: 'On the fifteenth day the emperor went to Shangqing Palace; there was also an imperial banquet; by evening he returned inside.',
      analysis: 'After the procession\u2019s dense visual inventory, Meng gives the fifteenth a single sentence. The emperor went to a Daoist palace, held the same banquet, and returned. The brevity is the entry\u2019s own statement about where the festival\u2019s center of gravity lay.' } ],
