  exitK: '02 / GO → RITUAL → RETURN', exitS: 'One sentence is enough.', exitP: 'After the procession\u2019s dense visual inventory, Meng gives the fifteenth a single sentence. The emperor went to a Daoist palace, held the same banquet, and returned. The brevity is the entry\u2019s own statement about where the festival\u2019s center of gravity lay.', exitQ: '亦有對御，至晚回內。',
  srcH2: 'One sentence. Both witnesses agree.', srcP: WITNESS + ' Both witnesses transmit this entry identically. The comparative Song Shu itinerary is labeled COMPARATIVE / OFFICIAL CALENDAR.',
