  exitK: '03 / VOLUME VI CLOSES', exitS: 'The book hands off to spring.', exitP: 'Volume VI opened with a permission and closes with an exodus. The lanterns are out; the capital empties into gardens and temples across a hundred li; spring arrives so visibly that Meng can count the flowers. The book hands off to Qingming — and Volume VII will follow the crowds again.', exitQ: '於是相繼清明節矣。',
  srcH2: 'The geography is relational. The claim is Meng\u2019s own hyperbole.', srcP: WITNESS + ' The 闃地 reading follows the Siku witness; 庶人園 is identified with the Yichun Garden tradition per the research lock. The seasonal handoff to Qingming is EDITORIAL / CROSS-ENTRY READING.',
